ysterious Space Whales. Whenever Tact visits the Whale Room, Tact can ask Kuromie to get a \"reading\" (by communicating with the Space Whales) on how all the Angels feel about him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Angel Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8880"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67a0e73ac2642c228a93aa2416036575de446c89fd4a64da4c1bba3016307cd5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85884b8a9a4e5dd7880cbdafc407810fe4a0d84d8d52243bdd3f8b5b0f987272.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"能登 麻美子","creatorId":"vndb:s468","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s468","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s468","name":"能登 麻美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8372","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c897","characterName":"ルフト・ヴァイツェン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c897"},"originalCharacterName":"ルフト・ヴァイツェン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Luft Weizen was a general in the Transbaal Empire Armed Forces, as well as Tact Mayers's old teacher. He not only rescued Takuto, but gave him command of both the Elle Ciel and Angel Troupe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Angel Wiki"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"At the end of the Galaxy Angel story he became Minister of Defence and Prime minister of Transbaal Empire"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c897"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/8622edee7b7bbce2f06d06a1d030676dc8fb1e66a0d7660d331ab8e2d93c5001.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/663e35833fbaada7b1ac8fe828b2888fa40197d67b62b5ca73fcb5bcedb38fd2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"納谷 六朗","creatorId":"vndb:s10569","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10569","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10569","name":"納谷 六朗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8384","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c898","characterName":"ノア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c898"},"originalCharacterName":"ノア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"141"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The administrator of the Black Moon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Galaxy Angel Wiki"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She became the foremost expert in Lost Technology in the Transbaal Empire, and spearheaded research and development efforts of new Lost Technology."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c898"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2c65c0880b6f467f2b93bdfedb1faf587a820a99175f20b48a1c4967564be4f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/626f2131bd53142fe6c0cc23d8626eed7f83090ec97aa7dcaba05a66dcd55253.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷井 あすか","creatorId":"vndb:s657","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s657","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s657","name":"谷井 あすか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8376","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c899","characterName":"シヴァ・トランスバール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":